      "ObjectName": "816 Middle Yan'an Road-20220723122541",
      "ImageDescription": "Former residence of Yan Tongchun. Since 2015, it became the headquarters of Jiefang Daily ."
    },
    "photographer": "Shwangtianyuan",
    "capture_time": "2022-07-23T12:25:41",
    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "observations": [
      "At sidewalk level the brown leaf doors and squared upper grilles sit behind four light-brick vertical piers. The broad middle opening retains at least six visible carved lower leaf faces and four glazed toplights.",
      "Above the projecting stone beam are rectangular spandrel panels with small scroll brackets and dark metal window sash. The right side and upper edge are interrupted by foliage. A Shanghai heritage plaque is fixed beside the middle opening."
    ]
  },
  "local_history": {
    "url": "https://www.jfdaily.com/wx/detail.do?id=824221",
    "bytes": 26711,
    "sha256": "b3bdab0049e77303dbfe4b8e644bb89f0223dd6f813e26f2ac14ae479ed61869",
    "published": "2024-12-01",
    "period": 1933,
    "architect": "林瑞骥",
    "source": "严寿沄、严寿蘩、严尔衡在旧居参加活动，严寿沄说明宅院归属及使用变迁。",
    "reported_points": [
      "816号东宅曾由长子严载如一房居住，830号西宅由另一房居住。严同春是沙船商号；严应钧属于该家族。",
      "院内记为A、B、C三幢，原第一进沿马路设门房和接待室；主楼前有天井。",
      "1998年拓宽延安路时第一进拆除，主楼与花园保存。街面照片中的木扇、墙面和窗列以2022年所见为时间依据。"
    ]
  },
  "courtyard_photo": {
    "url": "https://images.shobserver.com/img/2024/11/29/l_CB20241129211153724069.jpeg",
    "bytes": 183325,
    "sha256": "631b2a236d5ed860457106522c54c3f434d20e4fb97345cd23fc05c9bc2cff8f",
    "dimensions": [
      900,
      600
    ],
    "caption": "昔日的“严同春宅”，如今的解放日报办公点",
    "model_scope": "Published with the 2024 family history. The court-facing front has open wood-glazed gallery bays at multiple levels and a stair. Its roof and entrance are distinct from the 2022 street photograph."
  },
  "office_history": {
    "url": "https://www.shobserver.com/wx/detail.do?id=8194",
    "bytes": 19529,
    "sha256": "5501f345e19444c3c8022e54da04bb05bf5d8818844373c8adc80078b22e728b",
    "published": "2015-12-18",
    "use": "报社刊文记录当日从闵行迁入816号，称原业主为沙船商严应钧；2024年家属报道分别注明商号、户主和两宅门牌。"
  },
  "limits": [
    "The historic house was built in 1933. The date and extent of reconstruction of the present street-facing doors and spandrels have not been established.",
    "The model ends above the visible second-level window heads. The courtyard elevation, rear roof, 830 West House, road barrier, subsequent office installations and vegetation are outside this study.",
    "Widths, depth of reveal, painted tones, fine relief and repetitions behind trunks or the front piers are estimated."
  ],
